{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/17663-who-wants-to-live-forever","id":17663,"title":"Who wants to live forever?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-25T05:47:24-08:00","id":17663,"title":"Who wants to live forever?","content":"<i>When I Fell, I was told the same thing I will now tell you. There are others like us, and they have long spoken of a legend that one day, we would hear a calling towards a faraway land, and the last of us will claim the Prize.<br /> <br /> It is curious, and unfortunate, that you are to Fall on this day. Curious, because the Machine has now called the Gathering. Unfortunate, because there can be only one.<br /> <br /> I am called Mr. Cloud, and I am immortal.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T07:56:55-08:00","id":17707,"title":"","content":"While cool, it's more of a stretch than the system allows at this point.<br /> <br /> Still, Mr. Cloud is now totally an exile with more of a leaning towards the demon side as far as my world is concerned(not that Connor didn't already exist...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T08:26:37-08:00","id":17725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/17663-who-wants-to-live-forever?p=17707#post17707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While cool, it's more of a stretch than the system allows at this point.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you sure? On what grounds? Deciding that the best way to deal with demons is to have them all <i>deal with each other</i>, leaving only one demon left? That sounds exactly like the efficient logic of a machine to me. When I'm not at work at some point, I'll write up an Exploit (or even an Embed, since the hard/costly/risky part should be defeating another demon, and the God-Machine would want to incentivise this activity by conveniently making a backdoor for it) for absorbing the power of the demons you kill. The Prize? The fifth key in your Cipher, the thing everyone thinks is impossible... I don't see what else that is missing mechanically. We already have characters that systematically switch identities as their old ones get too old, with flawless memories and loads of paranoia towards each other as well as the unexplained, foreboding nature of the Gathering, an event which can be easily attributed as output of a complex series of God-Machine projects. Projects created seemingly with the sole purpose of reducing the number of anomalies in the system, ie demon genocide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","user":"sikker","date":". 11-25-2013, 11:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T15:05:33-08:00","id":17954,"title":"","content":"Except that Mummy has the Highlander market fairly well cornerered, what with them being.. immortal IN the system, and having the ability to use Bane affinities to steal life and power from each other. My bane mummy villain is pretty much the Kurgan. I mean, the themes for that really are a stretch, and its a stretch directly into another game's territory. The &quot;prize&quot; of being the last mummy and devouring all others? You are Azar, you break time, and you become the god-pharaoh. Demons are like falling stars, and burn out fast. This is actually a huge plot thing in my mummy demon crossover--for the first time in a few thousand years, the mummy's angelic wife could die, forever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T15:12:49-08:00","id":17963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cleverest of Things</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/17663-who-wants-to-live-forever?p=17954#post17954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I mean, the themes for that really are a stretch, and its a stretch directly into another game's territory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. By that token, the <i>entirety</i> of Mummy is a stretch into Vampire's territory.<br /> <br /> Your plot points in your particular chronicle in a game with no relation to this doesn't really concern this topic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}